  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment for Vocational Centers in Mauritania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to contribute to building an effective, equitable and inclusive Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET) system that serves the economy, contribute to its competitiveness and growth and equip young men and women with the required skills and competencies to improve their employability and help them integrate quickly and sustainably into decent jobs. Such a system should also enable companies to improve the skills of their workers through continuous and effective training. More specifically, the project aims at expanding access and improving the quality of VT systems to meet the needs of the economic stakeholders in terms of skills required to develop the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
